            <div xml:id="d536">

                <pb facs="0593" n="505" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg505"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/1446: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Geneva</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gilbert</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-03-18T16:00:00+01:00">March 18, 1933—4 [<hi
                                rendition="#italic">1?</hi>] p.m.</date><lb/>[Received March 18—9:30
                        a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>81. Wilson’s No. 153, March 18, 2 p.m. [<hi rendition="#italic">9
                        a.m.?</hi>]<anchor n="47" xml:id="d536-f1"/> Report and Council resolution
                    in Colombia-Peruvian dispute adopted unanimously by the Council at meeting just
                    terminated. Accepted by Colombia. Not accepted by Peru. Details of the meeting
                    follow.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gilbert</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
